<h2 id="ha-ctrl-003-acceptance">Acceptance and evidence</h2>

1. Test a 0.5 step, a negative range and exact endpoints. Check that the accessible value and the native formatted display agree.
2. Using only the keyboard, adjust the value and reach any essential action set for hold or double tap. Test touch without relying on hover.
3. Load unknown and unavailable values. Neither may announce a numeric minimum as a reading.
4. Change capabilities and reported values during an edit. Check duplicate-request prevention, error recovery, zoom, and that removing the theme leaves the native control working.

Record what was tested using [Native task accessibility and evidence](native-task-accessibility.html). A source review or a local example is not a live-device check.

